   \[
   \text{Cu} \rightarrow \text{Cu}^+ + e^- \quad \text{E}^\circ = 0.342 \text{ V}
   \]

2. **Cathode (reduction):** Silver will be reduced at the cathode.
   \[
   \text{Ag}^+ + e^- \rightarrow \text{Ag} \quad \text{E}^\circ = 0.7996 \text{ V}
   \]

The cell potential (\( E^\circ \)) is calculated as:
