\[ 5200 \times 20 = 104,000 \text{ cm} \]
Now, we find the speed of Lucy. The speed of Lucy is 90 steps per minute, each 55 cm long. The speed in cm per minute is:
\[ 90 \times 55 = 4950 \text{ cm/min} \]
