The relativistic Doppler effect is \(\boxed{\nu' = \gamma \nu}\), and the law of aberration of light is \(\boxed{\theta' = \tan^{-1} \left( \frac{\1000 \text{ \text{}} \text{1000}} \right)\).",relevance,"# Task Description
