     We are given Re = 40,000 and L = 0.2 m. We need to find the velocity (V) and know the properties of air at 500°C (in SI units).  

     At 500°C (273 K), the properties of air are:  
     - Density (ρ) ≈ 0.0011 kg/m³  
     - Dynamic Viscosity (μ) ≈ 0.000000015 Pa·s (15 μPa·s)  

