   \]
   The entropy change of the gas is:
   \[
   S_{\text{gas}} = \frac{Q_{\text{gas}}}{T_{\text{gas,1}}} - \frac{Q_{\text{gas}}}{T_{\text{gas,2}}} = \frac{525.52m_{\text{gas}}}{1100} - \frac{525.52m_{\text{grain}}}{550} = 0.475 \times m_{\text{gas}} - 0.959 \times m_{\text{gas}} = -0.484 m_{\text{gas}} \text{ kJ/K}
