   \[
   S_{\text{water}} = \frac{Q_{\text{water}}}{T_{\text{water}}} = \frac{1858.5}{220} = 8.44 \text{ kJ/K}
   \]

3. **Total entropy change (\(S_{\text{total}}\))**:
   The total entropy change is the sum of the entropy changes of the gas and the water:
   \[
