   The energy released by the HMTH explosion is given by the formula for the energy of a spherical sphere:
   \[
   E = \frac{3}{2} \left( \frac{P V}{\gamma} \right)
   \]
   where \( P = 1.0 \text{ kbar} = 1.0 \times 10^5 \text{ Pa} \), \( V = 1.0 \text{ L} = 1.0 \times 10^{-3} \text{ m}^3 \), and \( \gamma = 1.4 \).

