   \]
   \[
   \frac{1}{r^{1.4}} = 1 - 0.56 = 0.44
   \]
   \[
   r^{1.4} = \frac{1}{0.44} \approx 2.27
   \]
   \[
   r = (2.27)^{1/1.4} \approx 1.56
   \]
   The compression ratio is \(\boxed{1.56}\).

