\[
I = \frac{b t^3}{12}
\]

Substituting this into the deflection formula:

\[
\delta = \frac{\pi^3 P L}{24 E \left(\frac{b t^3}{12}\right)} = \frac{\pi^3 P L}{2 E b t^3}
\]

Thus, the maximum deflection is:

\[
\boxed{\delta = \frac{\pi^3 P L}{2 E b t^3}}
\]
